量子描述不完备」和「超距作用」之间二选一，决定论从来不是前提而是被推断出来的结论。贝尔定理的完整逻辑必须从这里讲起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span><span class=\"tag\">EPR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"量子终局不是比比特干净，是比谁能用手机芯片产线量产 量子计算的终局不是比谁的比特更干净，而是比谁能用现有半导体产线量产；硅自旋比特复用 TSMC 光刻机，而离子阱卡在十万束激光、超导卡在仓库级制冷机。 From First Principles From First Principles Why Spin Qubits Will Win the Quantum Race (Part 2) (EP 55) 量子计算 硅自旋 半导体 超导 离子阱 AI自动调谐 transmon valley splitting 2DEG DETR exchange-only qubit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-fromfirstprinc-硅自旋将赢-百万比特只需一块硅晶圆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">3:46:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>量子终局不是比比特干净，是比谁能用手机芯片产线量产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子计算的终局不是比谁的比特更干净，而是比谁能用现有半导体产线量产；硅自旋比特复用 TSMC 光刻机，而离子阱卡在十万束激光、超导卡在仓库级制冷机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">硅自旋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 芯片出货量将跳一个量级：从百万颗到 1500 万颗 Broadcom 总裁展示 AI 芯片路线图：从百万颗走向 1500 万颗，「beast」是 8 个可堆叠计算 die 加 16 个 HBM 的最大封装，五家前沿实验室有四家在合作。 TechTechPotato TechTechPotato Future GPUs Will Look Like This 定制芯片 ASIC 先进封装 HBM Broadcom 算力供应链 back-end design services HBM CoWoS scaleup fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-techtechpotato-未来-ai-定制芯片的形态-一只带-16-个-hbm-的巨兽/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f1cfd222dffd8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span clas